1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,552
Now immerse a solid cylinder.

2
00:00:02,552 --> 00:00:05,104
The water pushes on every face.

3
00:00:05,104 --> 00:00:07,838
The sideways pushes cancel in pairs.

4
00:00:07,838 --> 00:00:10,234
On top, the water presses down.

5
00:00:10,234 --> 00:00:11,992
Underneath, it presses up.

